                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is borderline unplayable, the gameplay is floaty and nauseating. The game isn't optimized, and going into your inventory can freeze the game. You cannot swim, and can fall through the map if jumping into any body of water from a high enough place. Sometimes you spawn with a hammer, other times you do not, and without the hammer the game is seemingly unplayable. I actually can't think of anything positive about this game, it just feels cheap and uninspired at best, and a broken, lazy Unturned clone at worst. It's not worth your time, effort, and especially not your money.\n\nAdditionally, if you are a curator (I am the curator for One Death Gaming Crew, check us out: https://store.steampowered.com/curator/11346771-One-Death-Gaming-Crew/) searching the title for the game \"ROCK\" or \"KILL\" will not work. I was contacted to review the game through curator connect, but it will not allow me to review the game, so this is the best I can do (if the developers can contact me about this, please do so).",
